### 1. Health Check Endpoint
GET http://localhost:8001/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Upload Document - Text File (Fixed Chunking Strategy)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/v1/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunking_strategy"

fixed
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunk_size"

300
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunk_overlap"

50
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ../samples/sample.txt
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### 3. Upload Document - PDF File (Recursive Chunking Strategy)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/v1/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunking_strategy"

recursive
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunk_size"

400
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="chunk_overlap"

80
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../samples/sample.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### 4. List Documents (Paginated)
GET http://localhost:8001/api/v1/documents?limit=10&offset=0
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Get Document Details by ID
GET http://localhost:8001/api/v1/documents/REPLACE_WITH_DOCUMENT_ID
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Delete Document and Vector Embeddings
DELETE http://localhost:8001/api/v1/documents/REPLACE_WITH_DOCUMENT_ID
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Conversational RAG - Initial Question
POST http://localhost:8001/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "demo-session-001",
  "message": "What is the document ingestion pipeline?"
}

###

### 8. Conversational RAG - Follow-up Question (Contextual Query Rewriting)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "demo-session-001",
  "message": "What chunking strategies are supported by it?"
}

###

### 9. Interview Booking Flow - Turn 1 (Initiate Booking)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "booking-session-999",
  "message": "I would like to book a candidate interview."
}

###

### 10. Interview Booking Flow - Turn 2 (Provide Name and Email)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "booking-session-999",
  "message": "My name is Alice Smith and my email is alice@example.com"
}

###

### 11. Interview Booking Flow - Turn 3 (Provide Date and Time)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "booking-session-999",
  "message": "I want to schedule for 2026-11-15 at 14:00"
}

###

### 12. Interview Booking Flow - Turn 4 (Explicit Confirmation)
POST http://localhost:8001/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "session_id": "booking-session-999",
  "message": "confirm"
}

###

### 13. List Confirmed Bookings (Paginated)
GET http://localhost:8001/api/v1/bookings?limit=10&offset=0
Accept: application/json
